[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":38},"en/routes/conteudo-do-cubo.tsx",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10,"_11":12,"_13":14,"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":-7,"_20":21,"_22":23,"_24":-7,"_25":26},"tipo","etapa","cubo",{"_11":35,"_13":36,"_28":37},"id","f2l","nome","Middle layers","rascunho",false,"html","<p>With the white face done, build the layers around it, from the bottom up, until only the top face is left. There are 4 steps, and each one uses a short algorithm, similar to the 3x3 ones. In all of them, the algorithm only moves the piece going in: what&#39;s already done stays done.</p>\n<h2>1. The edges between the bottom faces</h2>\n<p>The 5 edges between two bottom faces (between <code>DR</code> and <code>DL</code>, for example), above the white corners. Hold it with the empty spot in front, on the bottom, and take the edge to one of the bottom borders of the front face, turning the top faces. It goes in one of these two ways:</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/21f2199b4465cf18.svg\" alt=\"On the left border, with the DR color facing front: `F DR F' DR' F' DL' F DL`.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>On the left border, with the DR color facing front: <code>F DR F&#39; DR&#39; F&#39; DL&#39; F DL</code>.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/d1efea624d657a9e.svg\" alt=\"On the right border, with the DL color facing front: `F' DL' F DL F DR F' DR'`.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>On the right border, with the DL color facing front: <code>F&#39; DL&#39; F DL F DR F&#39; DR&#39;</code>.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>If the edge is in place, but flipped, do one of the two to take it out and put it in again.</p>\n<h2>2. The 3rd layer corners: another sexy move</h2>\n<p>The 5 corners right above those edges, at the bottom tip of each top face. The <a href=\"/en/glossary#sexy-move\" class=\"termo-do-glossario\" title=\"The trigger R U R' U', the most common of all.\">sexy move</a> is now <code>R&#39; F&#39; R F</code>: take the corner to the bottom right tip of the front face (between <code>F</code>, <code>R</code> and <code>DR</code>) and repeat until it goes in.</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/541c77832d0efaef.svg\" alt=\"The front face's color facing front: 1 sexy move.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The front face&#39;s color facing front: 1 sexy move.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/b4bcf9922aafca1b.svg\" alt=\"Facing down (DR): 3 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Facing down (DR): 3 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/998106ceeb90eece.svg\" alt=\"Facing right (R): 5 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Facing right (R): 5 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>3. The 3rd layer edges</h2>\n<p>The 10 edges between a top face and a bottom face, on both sides of each corner from the previous step. The edge comes from the top layer:</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/c860da5210778f92.svg\" alt=\"On top, on the left, with the front color facing left: `U' F2' U F2 U F2' U' F2` (goes to the bottom right).\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>On top, on the left, with the front color facing left: <code>U&#39; F2&#39; U F2 U F2&#39; U&#39; F2</code> (goes to the bottom right).</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/1955c0b7937a26f6.svg\" alt=\"On top, on the right, with the front color facing right: `U F2 U' F2' U' F2 U F2'` (goes to the bottom left).\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>On top, on the right, with the front color facing right: <code>U F2 U&#39; F2&#39; U&#39; F2 U F2&#39;</code> (goes to the bottom left).</figcaption></figure></div>\n<h2>4. The 4th layer</h2>\n<p>Last, the 5 corners between two top faces and a bottom one, and the 5 edges between two top faces. It&#39;s just like the 3x3&#39;s 1st and 2nd layers. The corners go in with the 3x3 sexy move, <code>R U R&#39; U&#39;</code>, from the top layer:</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/f35bcb1ae552f261.svg\" alt=\"The front face's color facing front: 1 sexy move.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>The front face&#39;s color facing front: 1 sexy move.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/02da154b94b8b3ab.svg\" alt=\"Facing right (R): 3 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Facing right (R): 3 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/01ecc48876e0a5d3.svg\" alt=\"Facing up (U): 5 sexy moves.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>Facing up (U): 5 sexy moves.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>And the edges, with the 3x3 2nd layer algorithms, starting from the edge on top, in front, with the front color facing front:</p>\n<div class=\"diagramas\"><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/7168660f925453ef.svg\" alt=\"To the right: `U R U' R' U' F' U F`.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>To the right: <code>U R U&#39; R&#39; U&#39; F&#39; U F</code>.</figcaption></figure><figure class=\"diagrama\"><img src=\"/imagens/diagramas/04758ecd1b470814.svg\" alt=\"To the left: `U' L' U L U F U' F'`.\" width=\"140\" height=\"140\" loading=\"lazy\"><figcaption>To the left: <code>U&#39; L&#39; U L U F U&#39; F&#39;</code>.</figcaption></figure></div>\n<p>Done: only the top face is left, with the last layer cards.</p>\n","treino","metodos",[30],"anterior",{"_13":27,"_28":29},"proximo","grupos",[],"Star and 1st face","endereco","/megaminx/estrela",{"_13":31,"_32":33,"_28":34},"Layers","numero",2,"/megaminx/camadas#f2l","megaminx","Megaminx","/megaminx/",{"_39":40,"_41":42},"cubos",[45,46,47,48,49,50],"idiomas",[43,44],"pt","en",{"_11":56,"_13":56},{"_11":55,"_13":55},{"_11":54,"_13":54},{"_11":53,"_13":53},{"_11":35,"_13":36},{"_11":51,"_13":52},"pyraminx","Pyraminx","5x5","4x4","2x2","3x3"]
